&quot;BC Sans&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, sans-serif !important;\">Individual farm information will not be shared without your explicit consent</li><li style=\"font-family:BCSans, &quot;BC Sans&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, sans-serif !important;\">You have the right to access and correct your personal information</li></ul></div>",
