      "quartech_section6": "<div class=\"ck-content\" data-wrapper=\"true\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"--ck-image-style-spacing: 1.5em; --ck-inline-image-style-spacing: calc(var(--ck-image-style-spacing) / 2); font-family: Segoe UI; font-size: 11pt;\"><h4 style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:&quot;Roboto Slab&quot;, Georgia, serif !important;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;\">5. Limitation of Liability</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: BCSans, &quot; undefined: BCSans&quot; undefined: ,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot; undefined: SegoeUI&quot; undefined: ,Roboto,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">The Environmental Farm Plan program and its administrators:</p><ul style=\"list-style-position: inside; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: BCSans, &quot; undefined: BCSans&quot; undefined: ,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot; undefined: SegoeUI&quot; undefined: ,Roboto,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><li style=\"font-family:BCSans, &quot;BC Sans&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, sans-serif !important;\">Provide information and recommendations in good faith</li><li style=\"font-family:BCSans, &quot;BC Sans&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, sans-serif !important;\">Are not liable for any damages resulting from the use or implementation of recommendations</li><li style=\"font-family:BCSans, &quot;BC Sans&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFo